{{Politics of Balisca}}

The '''Secretariat for the Future''' ({{langx|bl|Secretaría del Futuro}}; {{langx|mxi|سِكْرِتارِيَا بَارَا الْفُتُورُو|Sikritariya para al-Fútūru}}) is an [[Secretariat Council (Balisca)|agency]] of the [[confederal government of Balisca]], dedicated to long-term strategic foresight, intergenerational equity, and ensuring the [[W:Sustainable development|sustainable development]] of the Baliscan Confederation. Established in October 2022 in response to escalating [[W:2020s in history|global challenges]] (i.e. the [[W:Climate crisis|climate crisis]]) and accelerated societal transformation, the Secretariat is tasked with integrating future-oriented thinking into all levels of Baliscan policy-making, advocating for the well-being of generations yet to come.

